{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"曾国藩·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"zeng-guofan","categoryLabel":"曾国藩","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/27_zeng-guofan/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"曾国藩-核心贡献\">曾国藩·核心贡献</h1><p>曾国藩（1811—1872）被誉为晚清「中兴名臣」之首，又被尊为「修身、齐家」的千古典范。本 hub 系统梳理他<strong>真正落地、影响后世</strong>的核心贡献，并贯穿一条统一线索：<strong>面对人性必然的惰性与腐化，用清晰、可执行、可日检的制度去对冲</strong>——无论是治理自己（修身）、治理组织（治军/洋务）还是治理家族（治家），他用的是同一套「以制度对抗熵增」的方法论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-涵盖三大贡献\">本 hub 涵盖三大贡献</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>一句话定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 修身楷模</td>\n<td><a href=\"a-model-of-self-cultivation/the-art-of-self-discipline\">自律的功夫</a> · <a href=\"a-model-of-self-cultivation/perseverance-and-diligence\">勤奋与坚韧</a></td>\n<td>资质平常者如何靠日课十二条、尚拙、屡败屡战成就三不朽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 经世之才</td>\n<td><a href=\"statecraft-and-reform/the-xiang-army-system\">湘军的制度</a> · <a href=\"statecraft-and-reform/pioneer-of-modernization\">洋务的开创</a></td>\n<td>军事组织创新（兵为将有/厚饷）与中国近代化的第一批落地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 齐家典范</td>\n<td><a href=\"family-instruction/the-family-letters-legacy\">家书的智慧</a> · <a href=\"family-instruction/cultivating-a-family\">治家与家风</a></td>\n<td>1500 封家书与八字诀如何破解「富不过三代」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub（分工）</h2><p>曾国藩条目下共有 6 个 hub，彼此分工明确，避免重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本 hub（2 核心贡献）</strong>：讲他<strong>做成了什么</strong>——具体的贡献、制度、成果及其机理。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a>：讲他的<strong>人生历程</strong>（湖南书生→创建湘军→中兴重臣的叙事时间线）。本 hub 引用其中的战役与建军事件，但不复述生平。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a>：讲他贡献背后的<strong>思想原理</strong>（修养之道、处世智慧、领导艺术）。本 hub 讲「制度怎么运作」，思想 hub 讲「为什么这样想」。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a>：讲《家书》《日记》等作为<strong>文献</strong>的成书、体裁与地位。本 hub 的「家书」篇讲它<strong>承载的智慧</strong>，著作 hub 讲它作为<strong>文本</strong>本身。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a>：讲他贡献的<strong>后续传播与影响</strong>（影响了谁、文化遗产、当代价值）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a>：讲他贡献的<strong>阴暗面与争议</strong>（镇压太平天国、忠清的两难、总体评价）。本 hub 在湘军、洋务篇中点出争议并链接至此，不在本 hub 下定结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[本 hub: 核心贡献] --&gt; B[3 思想与方法&lt;br/&gt;理解原理]&#10;  A --&gt; C[6 争议与评价&lt;br/&gt;建立批判视角]&#10;  D[1 生平与时代&lt;br/&gt;先建立时间线] -.前置.-&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; E[5 影响与遗产&lt;br/&gt;看后续影响]\">flowchart LR\n  A[本 hub: 核心贡献] --&gt; B[3 思想与方法&lt;br/&gt;理解原理]\n  A --&gt; C[6 争议与评价&lt;br/&gt;建立批判视角]\n  D[1 生平与时代&lt;br/&gt;先建立时间线] -.前置.-&gt; A\n  A --&gt; E[5 影响与遗产&lt;br/&gt;看后续影响]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置（可选）</strong>：若不熟悉曾国藩生平，先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a> 建立时间线，再回到本 hub。</li>\n<li><strong>本 hub 内部顺序</strong>：建议按「修身 → 经世 → 齐家」顺序阅读——这也是「修身、齐家、治国平天下」的儒家逻辑顺序，且后两章会回指第一章的方法论内核。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完本 hub 想深究「为什么」，转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a>；想要批判性地评价其历史作用，必读 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一句话总览\">一句话总览</h2><p>曾国藩的核心贡献，是用同一套「以制度对抗惰性与腐化」的方法论，在<strong>个人、组织、家族</strong>三个尺度上都做出了可考、可学、影响深远的成果——也正因如此，他既是争议人物，又是后世最普及的修身榜样。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-model-of-self-cultivation","title":"A Model Of Self Cultivation","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/a-model-of-self-cultivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-art-of-self-discipline","title":"自律的功夫：日课十二条与「检身于密」","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/a-model-of-self-cultivation/the-art-of-self-discipline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"perseverance-and-diligence","title":"勤奋与坚韧：「尚拙」哲学与「屡败屡战」","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/a-model-of-self-cultivation/perseverance-and-diligence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"statecraft-and-reform","title":"Statecraft And Reform","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/statecraft-and-reform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-xiang-army-system","title":"湘军的制度：「兵为将有」与厚饷养兵的组织创新","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/statecraft-and-reform/the-xiang-army-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pioneer-of-modernization","title":"洋务运动的开创：「师夷长技以自强」的第一批落地","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/statecraft-and-reform/pioneer-of-modernization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"family-instruction","title":"Family Instruction","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/family-instruction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-family-letters-legacy","title":"家书的智慧：1500 封信里的「治家操作系统」","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/family-instruction/the-family-letters-legacy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cultivating-a-family","title":"治家与家风：八字诀、「富不过三代」的破局","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/core-contributions/family-instruction/cultivating-a-family"}]}]}